{"id":"n30882-2-9","stage":2,"title":"굉장히 · 非常","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n30882-2-9-1","ko":"여기는 그래도 우리나라보다 덜 더운 것 같습니다.","zh":"这里看起来还是比我们国家没那么热呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기는","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기는","audio":"/audio/c2a71127079ba19bce51.mp3"}},{"text":"그래도","meaning":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","explanation":"그래도：“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"그래도","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36264","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래도","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3"}},{"text":"우리나라보다","meaning":"我们；国，国家","explanation":"우리：我们；나라：国，国家；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"},{"term":"나라","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"2","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"29699","senseId":"1","lemma":"나라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리나라보다","audio":"/audio/8a68c4cedccd9b0dc359.mp3"}},{"text":"덜","meaning":"不够，不大，还没有","explanation":"덜：不够，不大，还没有。","readings":[{"term":"덜","audio":"/audio/f065d425b7fad87eff3e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48653","senseId":"1","lemma":"덜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"덜","audio":"/audio/f065d425b7fad87eff3e.mp3"}},{"text":"더운","meaning":"热，暑","explanation":"덥다：热，暑；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"덥다","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44484","senseId":"1","lemma":"덥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더운","audio":"/audio/2d08b046799650114bd9.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같습니다.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같습니다","audio":"/audio/70b461d79f2fe5361c43.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"82bd547e58bb6509","term":"그래도","zh":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3","entryId":"36264","definition":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己在内的一些人。一般对没有自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"02faec8ed1c75703","term":"나라","zh":"国，国家","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3","entryId":"29699","definition":"拥有一定领土与主权的、由居民组成的社会性组织。","pronunciation":["나라"]},{"id":"f065d425b7fad87e","term":"덜","zh":"不够，不大，还没有","audio":"/audio/f065d425b7fad87eff3e.mp3","entryId":"48653","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度弱，在那个程度之下。","pronunciation":["덜ː"]},{"id":"038a0682ef015c0a","term":"덥다","zh":"热，暑","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3","entryId":"44484","definition":"体感气温高。","pronunciation":["덥ː따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/5f88f74bdfd8b7fabb1a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n30882-2-9-2","ko":"그렇다면 거기 날씨는 굉장히 덥겠군요.","zh":"那样的话，那边的天气应该非常热吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그렇다면","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；다면：假定某情况成立：“如果、假如……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇다면","audio":"/audio/79d518fe0852e4a863c3.mp3"}},{"text":"거기","meaning":"那儿，那边，那里","explanation":"거기：那儿，那边，那里。","readings":[{"term":"거기","audio":"/audio/8c91c4ef7e321cf67426.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62258","senseId":"1","lemma":"거기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거기","audio":"/audio/8c91c4ef7e321cf67426.mp3"}},{"text":"날씨는","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날씨：天气；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"날씨","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60630","senseId":"1","lemma":"날씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"날씨는","audio":"/audio/2f60df2091f0018dcf73.mp3"}},{"text":"굉장히","meaning":"非常，惊人地","explanation":"굉장히：非常，惊人地。","readings":[{"term":"굉장히","audio":"/audio/5ffdea7285118469641b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30882","senseId":"2","lemma":"굉장히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"굉장히","audio":"/audio/5ffdea7285118469641b.mp3"}},{"text":"덥겠군요.","meaning":"热，暑","explanation":"덥다：热，暑；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"덥다","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44484","senseId":"1","lemma":"덥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"덥겠군요","audio":"/audio/fe112a8a320587fb7d30.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"8c91c4ef7e321cf6","term":"거기","zh":"那儿，那边，那里","audio":"/audio/8c